// Falling Notes Piano — a Synthesia-style falling-note piano video player.
// The whole app lives in index.html. Built-in songs are embedded there in the
// BUILTIN_SONGS array (one long JSON line near the top of the script) — add
// more by appending objects, or click "📂 MIDI" in the app to load any MIDI
// file at runtime.

